  "description": "YITAMOTOR provides you with the best innovative, quality products & professional services at competitive prices. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2016 - 2023 Toyota Tacoma Double Cab/Crew Cab Only\nNote: Automatic Transmisson Only, Will Not Fit Access Cabs\nOnly for Carpet Flooring.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: YITAMOTOR floor mats are compatible with Toyota Tacoma Double cab 2016 2017 2018 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023; 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back, Please remove old floor mats before installing new ones\nBuilt For Durability: YITAMOTOR Toyota Tacoma 2016-2023 floor mats are made from premium TPE material featuring high tensity for great comfort and wear-resistance while remaining flexible and user-friendly even in extreme cold or hot environments\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: Our 2023 Tacoma floor mats uniquely designed channels and raised edge can effectively trap liquid, debris, snow, mud, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; Built-in retainer clips to firmly grip the mat and prevent slipping when wet\nEasy To Clean: Simply shake the dirt out of the textured skid-resistant surface or spray down with a hose; No vacuuming or harsh chemicals needed for maintenance\nWhy Choose YITAMOTOR: Our 2023 tacoma floor mats are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guard to your vehicle",
